# F20 reproducer: take's index parameter is not bound inside an inlined user function on the tape (undefined variable: e); with a same-named global the index silently resolves to it and can panic out of range; checked by scripts/run-probes.
W = param[4, 4];
W = reshape(range(16), [4, 4]);
def u:col(g, e) {
  "Column e of g as a [4, 1] factor.";
  reshape(take(g, 1, e), [4, 1])
}
print("eager", u:col(W, 1));
print("grad", grad(reduce_add(u:col(W, 1) * W), W))
